<section class="home-example page-width" aria-labelledby="home-example-title">
<div><h2 id="home-example-title">See one incident from meaning to decision.</h2><p>Follow the Northstar example: a requirement, an attempted export, its evidence and the decision that follows. This is an illustrative case.</p></div>
